58
00:04:35,070 --> 00:04:37,206
If you strain it with so much workload,
this is what happens.

59
00:04:37,778 --> 00:04:40,565
Instead of replacing a new coil
and a shaft...

60
00:04:41,018 --> 00:04:42,526
buy a new motor.

61
00:04:43,238 --> 00:04:44,299
Don't even get me started.

62
00:04:45,455 --> 00:04:48,400
With no monsoon,
I've already lost everything I have.

63
00:04:48,900 --> 00:04:50,651
Do something
and get this motor working.

64
00:04:51,226 --> 00:04:53,503
-Oh, come on, Man.
-Who's this boy?

65
00:04:54,723 --> 00:04:55,229
