66
00:04:57,944 --> 00:04:58,518
Son?

67
00:05:01,814 --> 00:05:03,759
He's a helper boy at my workshop.

68
00:05:04,288 --> 00:05:05,518
Oh, oh! Hmm!

69
00:05:05,793 --> 00:05:07,753
Neither do I have a wife.

70
00:05:09,441 --> 00:05:11,284
Nor do I have a son to do my last rites.

71
00:05:11,941 --> 00:05:13,331
I'm just sailing through my life.

72
00:05:15,411 --> 00:05:16,323
Hey, Kanagu!

73
00:05:18,497 --> 00:05:19,755
Put it on speakerphone.

74
00:05:20,694 --> 00:05:21,138
Dad!

75
00:05:22,451 --> 00:05:23,755
Please talk to me for a minute.

76
00:05:27,304 --> 00:05:29,068
Didn't you say you don't have a son?

77
00:05:30,393 --> 00:05:31,927
But I hear someone calling you father
over the phone.

78
00:06:11,083 --> 00:06:12,232
They'll be here now.
Come on, hurry up!

79
00:06:12,336 --> 00:06:13,208
Come on, quick!

80
00:06:33,229 --> 00:06:34,513
Arasu Brother, come on, go ahead!

81
00:06:34,904 --> 00:06:35,911
Come on! Come on!

82
00:06:38,341 --> 00:06:39,372
Hand me your gun.

83
00:06:39,397 --> 00:06:41,198
Hand me your gun,
if not, I'll freaking kill you.

84
00:06:41,223 --> 00:06:41,982
Hand me the freakin' gun!

85
00:06:58,914 --> 00:06:59,830
Hop on!

86
00:07:00,772 --> 00:07:01,978
Das, hop in!

87
00:07:02,584 --> 00:07:03,909
Come on, drive!

88
00:07:12,564 --> 00:07:13,871
"Ready for the switch"

89
00:07:19,205 --> 00:07:20,016
Hey, Kitty!

90
00:07:21,265 --> 00:07:22,664
They seem like government guns.

91
00:07:23,573 --> 00:07:25,055
It's got that heavy government stench.

92
00:07:26,828 --> 00:07:29,453
Shut up, check the stash,
and offer your price.

93
00:07:30,089 --> 00:07:32,055
So, you agree it's the government stash.

94
00:07:32,554 --> 00:07:33,031
Hey!

95
00:07:34,063 --> 00:07:36,312
Stop squeezing your brain.
You got the weapons you wanted.

96
00:07:37,216 --> 00:07:39,437
Your master is well aware of us.

97
00:07:39,922 --> 00:07:41,398
Shut up and leave.
Unnecessarily yapping--

98
00:07:41,423 --> 00:07:42,430
Why are you getting worked up?

99
00:07:43,052 --> 00:07:46,172
This is not some junkyard stuff.
We use it to kill people.

100
00:07:46,448 --> 00:07:47,656
What if we get into trouble later?

101
00:07:48,138 --> 00:07:49,844
In two weeks, I'm getting married.

102
00:07:50,214 --> 00:07:51,844
Don't disappear
in the name of hiding out.

103
00:07:52,506 --> 00:07:54,281
I've arranged for a lip-smacking feast.

104
00:07:54,517 --> 00:07:56,016
You guys better make it.
Understand?

105
00:07:57,077 --> 00:08:01,703
Hey, Saami, I will personally sprinkle
rose water on the wedding guests.

106
00:08:01,995 --> 00:08:02,664
Enough?

107
00:08:02,865 --> 00:08:03,758
-Hey, Saami!
-Are you happy now?

108
00:08:04,384 --> 00:08:04,875
Brother!

109
00:08:05,134 --> 00:08:07,039
Grab him and the stuff
and get out of here fast.

110
00:08:07,064 --> 00:08:07,601
Here I come, Brother.

111
00:08:08,397 --> 00:08:09,279
Don't forget to come to the wedding.

112
00:08:11,526 --> 00:08:12,310
Can you believe it, Das?

113
00:08:12,929 --> 00:08:15,966
Even Saami is settling down
with a family.

114
00:08:17,733 --> 00:08:18,599
And Arasu Brother...

115
00:08:19,049 --> 00:08:21,825
has a son who will carry forward his name.

116
00:08:24,619 --> 00:08:28,888
Das, we should also look for
a suitable girl and get married.

117
00:08:29,317 --> 00:08:31,121
I, too, desire to lead a life
with a wife and kids.

118
00:08:31,466 --> 00:08:32,096
What do you say?

119
00:08:32,883 --> 00:08:33,841
As if we don't have enough problems.

120
00:08:34,727 --> 00:08:35,357
Shut up and drink!

121
00:08:36,034 --> 00:08:37,021
He will never change.

122
00:08:48,392 --> 00:08:49,888
Hey, Son, here you go.

123
00:08:50,899 --> 00:08:52,232
Give this to your mother.

124
00:08:52,451 --> 00:08:55,750
She's pissed at me and
walking ahead quickly.

125
00:08:56,024 --> 00:08:56,872
Hand this to her.

126
00:08:57,429 --> 00:09:00,372
Dad, does Grandpa also
address you as "son"?

127
00:09:00,905 --> 00:09:02,273
I will tell you about it all.

128
00:09:02,345 --> 00:09:05,645
You have one
and give your mother one too.

129
00:09:05,670 --> 00:09:07,782
Mom! Mom!

130
00:09:08,348 --> 00:09:10,948
I've been calling you.
Why aren't you paying attention?

131
00:09:11,176 --> 00:09:12,177
Stop, Mom!

132
00:09:12,617 --> 00:09:14,583
What do you want?
Why are you yelling?

133
00:09:15,013 --> 00:09:17,419
Here, Dad asked me to give you
an ice apple.

134
00:09:17,683 --> 00:09:19,099
I don't want it. You guys hog!

135
00:09:19,635 --> 00:09:22,021
Come on, Mom.
Are you going to eat or not?

136
00:09:22,627 --> 00:09:24,919
Give it back to that man.
I told you I don't want it.

137
00:09:25,335 --> 00:09:26,646
Mom, why are you getting angry?

138
00:09:26,735 --> 00:09:28,961
Why not? To your father,
the family isn't important.

139
00:09:28,986 --> 00:09:30,044
He's always concerned about your education.

140
00:09:30,707 --> 00:09:31,583
I wanted him to retain the property,

141
00:09:31,708 --> 00:09:32,943
but he's set
on your English-medium education.

142
00:09:33,214 --> 00:09:34,786
Do you think I don't care about you?

143
00:09:35,319 --> 00:09:36,990
That doesn't mean
he can yell at me in front of people.

144
00:09:37,222 --> 00:09:39,075
You can have all you want
and throw away the rest.

145
00:09:40,728 --> 00:09:43,099
Dad, she doesn't want to
have the ice apple.

146
00:09:43,124 --> 00:09:45,888
Fine, now tell me
why Grandpa doesn't visit us.

147
00:09:47,115 --> 00:09:50,349
My dear Son,
your Grandpa will visit us.

148
00:09:50,705 --> 00:09:51,654
Where else would he go?

149
00:09:52,254 --> 00:09:55,630
Your Grandpa has a dispute with me.

150
00:09:56,099 --> 00:09:56,529
That's it!

151
00:09:57,357 --> 00:10:00,341
He will have to come to see
his handsome grandson.

152
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,747
He should come.

153
00:10:02,092 --> 00:10:04,240
Dear wife! Dear wife!

154
00:10:04,977 --> 00:10:08,521
It's a pride if our son studies
in English medium school.

155
00:10:09,064 --> 00:10:11,247
Still six months left for the monsoon.

156
00:10:11,479 --> 00:10:14,349
By then, the house would've
drowned in mortgage.

157
00:10:16,370 --> 00:10:18,372
-It's scorching hot.
-Sir, why can't you give me a hand?

158
00:10:19,111 --> 00:10:21,247
Hey, do you expect the SI to help you?

159
00:10:21,357 --> 00:10:22,049
Pull out the barricades.

160
00:10:27,513 --> 00:10:29,156
Hey! Who are you?

161
00:10:29,864 --> 00:10:31,469
Sir, I'm Angani.
I'm from Thekkumalai.

162
00:10:32,371 --> 00:10:33,242
Go and help him with the barricades.

163
00:10:34,809 --> 00:10:37,555
Okay, Son, you go ahead with your mother.

164
00:10:37,965 --> 00:10:38,984
I'll follow you guys.

165
00:10:44,779 --> 00:10:46,615
Sir, please have some ice apple.
It'll help you cool down.

166
00:10:47,938 --> 00:10:49,443
Sir, how did it happen?

167
00:10:49,705 --> 00:10:52,794
How come someone stole guns
from the police themselves?

168
00:10:53,257 --> 00:10:54,294
Hey, get going!

169
00:10:55,087 --> 00:10:55,982
Okay, Sir.

170
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:05,896
Hey, what are you carrying?

171
00:11:06,704 --> 00:11:08,946
Sir, it's for my son's education.

172
00:11:09,198 --> 00:11:10,740
I sold all my properties.

173
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:14,107
And gathered 7 lakh rupees
to pay for his education.

174
00:11:14,563 --> 00:11:16,349
I'm going to put him in
English medium school.

175
00:11:17,562 --> 00:11:18,818
7 lakh rupees, you say?

176
00:11:26,845 --> 00:11:28,763
When he's carrying so much money,
why would he indulge in these things?

177
00:11:31,231 --> 00:11:32,669
Here, call your father.

178
00:11:34,634 --> 00:11:36,628
I hope you're not upset
that I got angry.

179
00:11:39,535 --> 00:11:41,963
We sold the land that fed us
to provide your education.

180
00:11:42,622 --> 00:11:43,604
You must study well, Son.

181
00:11:44,084 --> 00:11:46,448
I will study well.
You don't have to worry about it.

182
00:11:47,617 --> 00:11:50,010
I'm scared
that he's carrying so much money.

183
00:11:52,473 --> 00:11:54,532
Mom, I think his phone ran out of charge.

184
00:11:54,644 --> 00:11:55,837
It says switched off.

185
00:11:56,081 --> 00:11:58,159
With that much cash,
he should've come straight home.

186
00:11:58,653 --> 00:12:00,690
Let's go before he spends it all.

187
00:12:00,843 --> 00:12:01,269
Let's go!

188
00:12:12,885 --> 00:12:13,503
Dad!

189
00:12:14,921 --> 00:12:15,596
Dad!

190
00:12:19,874 --> 00:12:20,542
Dad!

191
00:12:25,371 --> 00:12:26,203
Dad!

192
00:12:32,018 --> 00:12:34,409
Hey, go further and check
if you can find your Dad.

193
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,604
Dear!

194
00:12:39,842 --> 00:12:40,378
Dad!

195
00:12:42,347 --> 00:12:43,253
Dear!

196
00:12:46,197 --> 00:12:46,917
Dad!

197
00:12:50,526 --> 00:12:52,698
-Dad!
-Dear!

198
00:12:59,588 --> 00:13:00,284
Mom!

199
00:13:01,886 --> 00:13:03,698
-Come over here.
-What is it?

200
00:13:07,268 --> 00:13:08,346
Look over there.

201
00:13:27,995 --> 00:13:31,250
It's been way too long
since we left him in the forest.

202
00:13:31,807 --> 00:13:35,336
I don't know if he's even alive, Brother.

203
00:13:35,367 --> 00:13:35,960
Don't cry, Mom.

204
00:13:35,985 --> 00:13:39,641
On our way home, a Police officer stopped
and asked him to help with barricades.

205
00:13:39,666 --> 00:13:41,250
That's the last I saw him.

206
00:13:41,781 --> 00:13:44,344
-Now he has disappeared!
-Don't cry, Mom.

207
00:13:44,369 --> 00:13:47,867
Oh, God,
I don't know what happened to him.

208
00:13:51,831 --> 00:13:54,260
Hey, don't push!
Don't push, woman!

209
00:13:54,436 --> 00:13:55,133
Get out of here!

210
00:13:55,208 --> 00:13:58,562
I'm warning you! If you don't leave,
I'll book you under a brothel case.

211
00:13:59,129 --> 00:14:00,831
Stop glaring at me.
Get out of here!

212
00:14:09,754 --> 00:14:10,976
What was the last thing
your father told you?

213
00:14:11,287 --> 00:14:13,719
Son, you go ahead with your mother.

214
00:14:14,025 --> 00:14:14,656
I'll follow you guys.

215
00:14:19,501 --> 00:14:21,427
Das, this is a Police matter.

216
00:14:22,583 --> 00:14:24,764
We just stole the guns.
I feel let's not rush this in.

217
00:14:27,003 --> 00:14:29,068
Why did you act in such haste?

218
00:14:32,507 --> 00:14:34,169
What would've happened to my father?

219
00:14:39,771 --> 00:14:42,318
That boy is clueless about
whether his father is alive.

220
00:14:42,342 --> 00:14:43,615
Yet don't want us to rush in.

221
00:14:44,774 --> 00:14:45,427
I will bring you the money.

222
00:14:46,143 --> 00:14:47,794
In a way, we're responsible for this.

223
00:14:47,819 --> 00:14:48,685
We must arrange the money.

224
00:14:51,455 --> 00:14:52,896
Study the way your father
always wanted you to.

225
00:15:00,836 --> 00:15:02,109
Sir, sir, please spare me.

226
00:15:02,140 --> 00:15:02,720
Hey!

227
00:15:02,745 --> 00:15:03,950
I have nothing to do with it.

228
00:15:06,793 --> 00:15:08,127
Please don't harm me.

229
00:15:09,904 --> 00:15:11,458
-Hey!
-Who the hell are you people?

230
00:15:11,913 --> 00:15:13,325
Why are you doing this?
Please spare me.

231
00:15:21,276 --> 00:15:24,700
Das, I feel they would've killed him.

232
00:15:26,698 --> 00:15:27,357
We'll find out!

233
00:15:28,036 --> 00:15:30,052
I don't know. I don't know.

234
00:15:30,156 --> 00:15:30,794
Let go of me!

235
00:15:33,421 --> 00:15:34,398
What did you do to him?

236
00:15:34,508 --> 00:15:35,570
I don't know anything.

237
00:15:39,385 --> 00:15:41,273
I'll confess! I'll confess!

238
00:15:41,344 --> 00:15:43,201
I'll confess!
A kilometer from that spot.

239
00:15:43,226 --> 00:15:44,453
A spot one kilometer from there.

240
00:15:44,829 --> 00:15:47,054
I discarded him a kilometer from there
in the bushes.

241
00:16:00,559 --> 00:16:01,867
Please spare me!

242
00:16:02,586 --> 00:16:04,164
I made a mistake.

243
00:16:04,189 --> 00:16:04,788
Kitty!

244
00:16:05,859 --> 00:16:07,406
-I beg you for my life.
-Inform the family not to file a case.

245
00:16:07,631 --> 00:16:08,914
Please spare me.

246
00:16:10,245 --> 00:16:11,551
I made a mistake.

247
00:16:19,100 --> 00:16:19,750
Money?

248
00:16:20,810 --> 00:16:24,140
We split the money equally among us.

249
00:16:26,963 --> 00:16:27,937
I called Arasu Brother.

250
00:16:28,527 --> 00:16:30,101
He asked us to lay low
at Yuvaraj's Lodge in Chennai.

251
00:16:33,027 --> 00:16:33,898
Come on, hurry up!

252
00:16:42,629 --> 00:16:44,062
I hope you were briefed about everything.

253
00:16:44,469 --> 00:16:44,797
Yes, Sir!

254
00:16:45,529 --> 00:16:49,023
In one instance, a team stole
our department's discarded guns.

255
00:16:49,819 --> 00:16:51,461
As it is, we're embarrassed
to reveal this incident.

