-Kitty, keep running.
-Run, everyone!

772
00:47:16,231 --> 00:47:18,117
It's the department pistol, Manoj.

773
00:47:18,460 --> 00:47:19,781
We'll trace it out, Sir.

774
00:47:22,038 --> 00:47:23,309
Run, Karuppu!

775
00:47:23,334 --> 00:47:25,084
Hey, this way. This way.

776
00:47:25,569 --> 00:47:26,384
Hey! Hey!

777
00:47:28,103 --> 00:47:29,391
Come on, Kitty!

778
00:47:30,078 --> 00:47:30,844
Don't stop!

779
00:47:31,335 --> 00:47:33,344
-Come on, run!
-Hey!

780
