[overlapping yelling]

781
00:47:50,513 --> 00:47:53,160
Hey, your gang member Sebastian is dead.

782
00:47:53,708 --> 00:47:54,927
Better confess the truth.

783
00:47:55,290 --> 00:47:56,568
If not, you're next!

