" Dhim tharikida thithithom,
We defied the world on all sides "

831
00:49:50,968 --> 00:49:53,459
" Tham tharikida thithithom,
Murugan's battle cry resounds! "

832
00:49:53,484 --> 00:49:55,417
Brother, this is Das speaking.

833
00:49:56,181 --> 00:49:57,260
Where are Kitty and Karuppan?

834
00:49:57,694 --> 00:49:59,003
They're hiding out
at Kitty's brother's place.

835
00:49:59,803 --> 00:50:01,221
Ask them to break
and throw away the SIM cards.

836
00:50:02,240 --> 00:50:05,099
" Bum Baa... Bum Baa Diga "

837
00:50:05,619 --> 00:50:07,293
" Bum Baa Diga Diga "

838
00:50:09,542 --> 00:50:10,753
What mess have you guys created?

839
00:50:11,409 --> 00:50:13,385
If Kitty had gotten married,
he would've fathered two children.

840
00:50:13,604 --> 00:50:15,932
Just because I'm his brother
I am living my life on edge.

841
00:50:17,501 --> 00:50:18,878
How long do I have to endure
this Police torture?

842
00:50:19,368 --> 00:50:20,620
For the past three days,
they've been hiding out here.

843
00:50:21,261 --> 00:50:22,370
I managed to convince my Boss.

844
00:50:22,964 --> 00:50:24,979
He's been rambling about going to Andhra.

845
00:50:25,331 --> 00:50:27,612
Das, ask him to stay put,
and I'll take care of him.

846
00:50:27,961 --> 00:50:29,421
At least he will stay alive.

847
00:50:31,014 --> 00:50:33,014
They've killed your friend Sebastian.

848
00:50:33,871 --> 00:50:35,956
They shot him dead.
I'm scared now.

849
00:50:36,231 --> 00:50:38,260
Please make him understand.
Come with me.

850
00:50:40,904 --> 00:50:45,081
Das, we should also look for
a suitable girl and get married.

851
00:50:45,488 --> 00:50:47,374
I, too, desire to lead a life
with a wife and kids.

852
00:50:48,643 --> 00:50:50,053
How did you leave Sebastian behind?

853
00:50:51,849 --> 00:50:53,022
They killed him, Das.

854
00:50:53,747 --> 00:50:55,245
Yuvaraj snitched on us.

855
00:50:55,859 --> 00:50:58,049
Bhojraj and his team shot him dead.

856
00:50:58,792 --> 00:50:59,870
We must shoot them, Das.

857
00:51:01,907 --> 00:51:04,586
We must not spare even one
we must shoot them all.

858
00:51:04,611 --> 00:51:06,956
Hey, moron!
Stop fueling him and sit quietly.

859
00:51:07,511 --> 00:51:10,104
Hey, he's not freaking fueling me.

860
00:51:10,890 --> 00:51:12,112
I'm going to kill them all.

861
00:51:12,406 --> 00:51:15,260
Yeah, Bhojraj is waiting
so that you can kill them all.

862
00:51:15,784 --> 00:51:18,338
If you keep going head on
we'll be dead in no time.

863
00:51:18,975 --> 00:51:22,378
Hey, Kitty! They killed our brother!

864
00:51:23,724 --> 00:51:25,182
Yet you want us to spare them.

865
00:51:28,867 --> 00:51:30,911
When you escaped
why didn't you go away?

866
00:51:30,936 --> 00:51:31,971
Why the heck did you come over here?

867
00:51:32,271 --> 00:51:34,823
We must deliver the money.
How could I abandon it?

868
00:51:35,162 --> 00:51:38,292
Let's drop everything, go to Andhra, change
our identities, and live a reformed life.

869
00:51:38,660 --> 00:51:43,608
My dear brother, it's enough that
you think of living a reformed life.

870
00:51:44,053 --> 00:51:46,053
You don't have to go to Andhra.

871
00:51:46,078 --> 00:51:47,388
Shut up and stay put.

872
00:51:47,777 --> 00:51:49,739
I will look after you.

873
00:51:49,938 --> 00:51:52,456
I can't stay here.
They won't let me live in peace.

874
00:51:53,712 --> 00:51:55,112
Enough with the melodrama!

875
00:51:55,656 --> 00:51:58,103
First, we must shoot Bhojraj!

876
00:51:58,383 --> 00:51:59,070
Damn it!

877
00:52:01,671 --> 00:52:05,870
But before we do that,
we must shoot that rascal Yuvaraj.

878
00:52:06,831 --> 00:52:08,057
What did he say
he would do to Sebastian?

879
00:52:09,913 --> 00:52:11,525
I will slit your throat!

880
00:52:17,043 --> 00:52:18,456
Now, you're talking, my friend.

881
00:52:18,698 --> 00:52:19,542
We're slitting his throat!

882
00:52:20,081 --> 00:52:22,019
We're slitting everyone's throat.

883
00:52:22,707 --> 00:52:23,759
We're doing it!

884
00:52:32,773 --> 00:52:33,831
Yuvaraj is hiding out here.

885
00:52:37,053 --> 00:52:39,034
-Fine, you may leave.
-Okay, Sir.

886
00:52:48,698 --> 00:52:50,768
-Yes, Brother.
-I tracked down Yuvaraj.

887
00:52:51,524 --> 00:52:52,932
Sait is sending his man
go with him.

888
00:52:54,222 --> 00:52:56,370
TN 33C 2124

889
00:52:56,635 --> 00:52:57,495
Red color Omni.

890
00:53:02,754 --> 00:53:04,878
Hey, isn't this Sebastian's shirt?

891
00:53:05,250 --> 00:53:07,198
-Not that important.
-Yes! Don't remind me of it.

892
00:53:17,904 --> 00:53:19,721
-Is he truly a Sait?
-How would I know?

893
00:53:19,995 --> 00:53:20,854
Arasu sent him.

894
00:53:21,276 --> 00:53:26,206
Even after looking at his attire
he doesn't come across as a Sait.

895
00:53:26,485 --> 00:53:27,370
Who's Kitty out here?

896
00:53:28,218 --> 00:53:30,323
That doesn't matter.
Who are you?

897
00:53:30,926 --> 00:53:32,471
Hey, I'm the one Arasu sent.

898
00:53:32,572 --> 00:53:34,635
-Name?
-Chunnilal.

899
00:53:35,702 --> 00:53:37,698
Hurry up and get inside the car.
We must leave before dawn.

900
00:53:38,580 --> 00:53:40,018
The police are on the lookout.

901
00:53:40,182 --> 00:53:40,690
[in Hindi] Let's go!

902
00:53:44,518 --> 00:53:45,385
They let him escape!

903
00:53:46,284 --> 00:53:48,401
He could've let us execute the encounter.

904
00:53:49,736 --> 00:53:51,581
Once again, we must start from scratch.

905
00:53:56,059 --> 00:53:58,456
-Das's father lives in Vellore, right?
-Yes, sir.

906
00:54:02,365 --> 00:54:04,229
-Put him under surveillance.
-Sure, sir.

907
00:54:05,343 --> 00:54:07,331
Dad, when are you coming home?

908
00:54:07,766 --> 00:54:08,948
Please come home soon.

909
00:54:10,206 --> 00:54:12,206
Don't you feel like
coming home to see us?

910
00:54:12,711 --> 00:54:14,635
I'll be home, Dear.
Please tell Mom.

911
00:54:14,659 --> 00:54:15,878
You must make her understand.

912
00:54:17,647 --> 00:54:21,659
I get the feeling someone in our department

913
00:54:22,673 --> 00:54:24,706
has helped them execute this robbery.

914
00:54:25,137 --> 00:54:28,081
No, Sir. We can't proceed in that
angle without any solid evidence.

915
00:54:28,939 --> 00:54:30,307
If we still proceed, we'll be in trouble.

916
00:54:31,352 --> 00:54:32,448
Sir, Banglapudur is on that side.

917
00:54:33,597 --> 00:54:35,323
And on this side
Gobichettipalayam G2 Police Station.

918
00:54:36,568 --> 00:54:39,417
There's confusion about which
jurisdiction this bridge falls under.

919
00:54:40,162 --> 00:54:42,292
That's why they're dragging this case out.

920
00:54:42,469 --> 00:54:43,862
Great, another pickle to handle.

921
00:54:46,251 --> 00:54:48,620
-Vehicle entry point?
-From this side, Gobichettipalayam.

922
00:54:51,846 --> 00:54:53,331
Even the file states the same.

923
00:54:54,393 --> 00:54:56,135
-Inform the station.
-Sure, Sir!

924
00:54:57,480 --> 00:54:59,710
-When will you come home, Dad?
-I'll talk to you later.

925
00:54:59,735 --> 00:55:00,253
Dad!

926
00:55:05,749 --> 00:55:06,512
Sir, I...

927
00:55:09,367 --> 00:55:11,909
Sir, I'm planning to resign from the job.

928
00:55:15,058 --> 00:55:17,792
Sir, I want to spend some time
with my family.

929
00:55:18,279 --> 00:55:18,784
Please!

930
00:55:23,249 --> 00:55:24,760
Family weakness.

931
00:55:27,372 --> 00:55:29,495
Why the heck
did you pick this line of work?

932
00:55:31,748 --> 00:55:33,393
Either you should've stayed single like me.

933
00:55:34,277 --> 00:55:38,573
Or else you should've married someone
who understood you and your profession.

934
00:55:40,081 --> 00:55:40,885
You didn't do either.

935
00:55:42,575 --> 00:55:44,354
Moreover, you had a child.

936
00:55:44,393 --> 00:55:46,553
And keep nagging me
to go and see them.

937
00:55:46,578 --> 00:55:47,565
What's this behavior, Ashraf?

938
00:55:49,510 --> 00:55:52,112
Sir, Sir, we should've... saved that girl.

939
00:55:57,635 --> 00:55:58,909
Collateral damage!

940
00:56:01,198 --> 00:56:02,120
We'll seek confession.

941
00:56:04,792 --> 00:56:05,893
-Manoj!
-Sir!

942
00:56:09,711 --> 00:56:12,792
Who got posted here
after the armed robbery?

943
00:56:15,146 --> 00:56:16,661
You both may go and do your duty.

944
00:56:17,060 --> 00:56:17,302
Go!

945
00:56:23,307 --> 00:56:25,708
Those who were not present on duty
during the armed robbery?

946
00:56:28,263 --> 00:56:29,036
You may leave as well.

947
00:56:32,179 --> 00:56:35,333
Why was no local security assigned
to the weapons truck?

948
00:56:35,867 --> 00:56:37,372
I was on a different duty
on that day, Sir.

949
00:56:37,677 --> 00:56:38,731
It was Arokiadoss on duty.

950
00:56:43,097 --> 00:56:43,784
You may go.

951
00:56:48,139 --> 00:56:48,573
Please come.

952
00:56:49,831 --> 00:56:50,284
Come!

953
00:56:52,273 --> 00:56:53,509
-Sir!
-Your name?

954
00:56:54,269 --> 00:56:56,713
-Arokiadoss, Sir.
-Arokiadoss!

955
00:56:57,221 --> 00:56:57,987
Yes, sir.

956
00:56:59,072 --> 00:57:01,213
-You do look fit.
-Sir!

957
00:57:03,010 --> 00:57:04,503
Do you know Arasu?

958
00:57:07,071 --> 00:57:07,890
I don't know him, Sir

959
00:57:07,915 --> 00:57:10,104
Fine, forget it. Not important.

960
00:57:10,299 --> 00:57:11,018
Now, tell me.

961
00:57:15,911 --> 00:57:18,497
Sir, Murugavel, sir
assigned the patrol vehicle.

962
00:57:18,842 --> 00:57:21,179
And asked me to follow the truck
with three other officers.

963
00:57:23,140 --> 00:57:26,576
So, you're saying only you knew
the truck's route and time.

964
00:57:27,804 --> 00:57:28,545
Yes, Sir.

965
00:57:29,800 --> 00:57:33,997
It was Murgavel, Sir, who asked me
to write down the timing details.

966
00:57:34,236 --> 00:57:35,104
I noted it down.

967
00:57:35,838 --> 00:57:38,503
The details about the truck
known exclusively to you

968
00:57:39,151 --> 00:57:41,204
how did Arasu and team came to know?

969
00:57:45,635 --> 00:57:46,208
Sir!

970
00:57:47,440 --> 00:57:52,424
I don't like it that you're questioning me
at my own station like I'm an accused.

971
00:58:04,200 --> 00:58:06,021
-Bhojraj is a Police officer.
-I get it, Brother.

972
00:58:06,082 --> 00:58:07,236
Let's not mess with him at the moment.

973
00:58:07,311 --> 00:58:09,492
Forget about that.
What happened to the money?

974
00:58:09,579 --> 00:58:11,355
I spoke to Saami
and made all the arrangements.

975
00:58:11,720 --> 00:58:13,240
Your priority is to kill Yuvaraj.

976
00:58:13,875 --> 00:58:15,888
You don't worry about Yuvaraj.
He's as good as dead now.

977
00:58:16,184 --> 00:58:18,247
We're here to surveil the place.
We'll kill him by tomorrow.

978
00:58:18,506 --> 00:58:20,177
Sait will help you guys cross the border.

979
00:58:20,576 --> 00:58:23,396
Arrange the money for Angani's family
and safely cross the border.

980
00:58:23,902 --> 00:58:24,825
Hey, give me a cigarette.

981
00:58:36,230 --> 00:58:37,597
Welcome, Arasu, sir.

982
00:58:39,681 --> 00:58:41,698
All your activities
are against the Government.

983
00:58:42,921 --> 00:58:44,104
But the irony is your name,
Arasu (Government).

984
00:58:45,731 --> 00:58:46,766
Are you mocking us?

985
00:58:51,148 --> 00:58:52,101
Do you recognize him?

986
00:58:54,070 --> 00:58:55,266
He's your informer!

987
00:58:56,385 --> 00:58:59,625
Despite giving you severe
shock treatment all over your body

988
00:59:00,428 --> 00:59:04,516
you still managed to father a child.

989
00:59:07,104 --> 00:59:09,930
Kitty, Das, and Karuppan.

990
00:59:10,743 --> 00:59:11,828
Where are these guys?

991
00:59:12,762 --> 00:59:15,367
So, please be good and tell me the truth.

992
00:59:20,181 --> 00:59:21,906
Hey, hot head.

993
00:59:22,521 --> 00:59:24,133
I've spoken to them.
Go ahead.

994
00:59:25,048 --> 00:59:26,789
You're going to do the deed.
So, be safe.

995
00:59:29,628 --> 00:59:30,859
Hey, your client is coming.

996
00:59:36,673 --> 00:59:38,788
Hey, Brother, is it your first time?

997
00:59:40,935 --> 00:59:42,758
But you don't look like a first-timer.

998
00:59:44,383 --> 00:59:46,070
Your face is scarred
like you were in a fight.

999
00:59:46,608 --> 00:59:49,562
You do look like a rugged guy.

1000
00:59:50,426 --> 00:59:51,512
Where are you from?

1001
00:59:51,945 --> 00:59:53,305
You don't seem like you're from here.

1002
00:59:54,075 --> 00:59:58,016
Listen, my girls are top-tucker.

1003
00:59:58,327 --> 00:59:59,422
Top class, you know!

1004
01:00:01,226 --> 01:00:04,266
The clients don't easily get over them.

1005
01:00:04,840 --> 01:00:07,914
If you're going to be stubborn about
not leaving, I'll cut your hands.

1006
01:00:10,416 --> 01:00:12,828
Hey, quickly finish the game.
Quickly finish it.

1007
01:00:18,757 --> 01:00:21,266
Listen for one time, it's 1,500 rupees.

1008
01:00:21,831 --> 01:00:22,742
We follow strict rules.

1009
01:00:22,824 --> 01:00:24,992
I don't mind if you treat her roughly.

1010
01:00:25,332 --> 01:00:28,375
If you want to go again,
then you will be charged another 1,500.

1011
01:00:45,318 --> 01:00:46,320
Nothing is going to happen tonight.

1012
01:01:01,800 --> 01:01:03,807
I was born and brought up in Coimbatore.

1013
01:01:05,892 --> 01:01:08,417
When I was young,
my sister went missing.

1014
01:01:12,687 --> 01:01:13,487
Are you from Coimbatore?

1015
01:01:15,287 --> 01:01:18,190
Why? Would you prefer
only a girl from Coimbatore?

1016
01:01:19,559 --> 01:01:20,401
Just answer the question.

1017
01:01:20,974 --> 01:01:24,713
Hey, please don't irritate me
during my bedtime.

1018
01:01:26,314 --> 01:01:26,706
Tell me!

1019
01:01:30,303 --> 01:01:30,870
Come on, tell me.

1020
01:01:33,523 --> 01:01:34,573
Oh, God!

1021
01:01:35,739 --> 01:01:38,578
When I was 6 years old,
they brought me here from Calcutta.

1022
01:01:39,538 --> 01:01:42,445
I've been in this room for 18 years now.

1023
01:01:45,247 --> 01:01:46,101
18 years, you say?

1024
01:01:49,567 --> 01:01:50,453
You're right!

1025
01:01:51,533 --> 01:01:52,453
Did you say Calcutta?

1026
01:01:53,745 --> 01:01:55,211
Yes, what about it?

1027
01:01:58,323 --> 01:01:59,031
But you speak Tamil.

1028
01:02:00,399 --> 01:02:04,539
Tamil, Telugu, Malayalam,
Hindi, Kannada, Bengali...

1029
01:02:05,028 --> 01:02:05,969
I speak all languages.

1030
01:02:07,387 --> 01:02:10,187
You say you never left this place for
18 years, yet know so many languages?

1031
01:02:13,738 --> 01:02:14,797
Right here, on this bed!

1032
01:02:16,515 --> 01:02:17,328
Are you here willingly?

1033
01:02:23,785 --> 01:02:24,406
Yeah, I am.

1034
01:02:25,641 --> 01:02:28,797
I pray to sleep with 10 people in a day.

1035
01:02:29,433 --> 01:02:32,133
If that isn't enough,
did you notice the boys outside?

1036
01:02:32,810 --> 01:02:34,789
The dogs who are playing carrom board.

1037
01:02:35,777 --> 01:02:39,297
Rape me often and record videos of it.

1038
01:02:40,552 --> 01:02:42,586
I prayed for this to happen as well.

1039
01:02:43,578 --> 01:02:45,789
To top it all,
the guy who brought you here...

1040
01:02:46,144 --> 01:02:47,570
That midget rascal you know...

1041
01:02:47,595 --> 01:02:49,461
Did it never occur to you
to visit your family in Calcutta?

1042
01:02:53,479 --> 01:02:54,656
It's my family who sold me to these devils.

1043
01:03:02,073 --> 01:03:03,500
Are you going to do the deed or talk?

1044
01:03:11,752 --> 01:03:14,734
This man makes so much money
but rides in an auto.

1045
01:03:15,205 --> 01:03:16,172
He won't spend!

1046
01:03:16,430 --> 01:03:18,156
He won't spend a penny.

1047
01:03:36,521 --> 01:03:38,562
Das, he has arrived.
Be ready.

1048
01:03:39,151 --> 01:03:41,039
Hey, just do a recon.

1049
01:04:14,288 --> 01:04:17,391
I've been in this room for 18 years now.

1050
01:04:21,399 --> 01:04:24,914
Rape me often and record videos of it.

1051
01:04:29,878 --> 01:04:31,508
Family is always a weakness.

1052
01:04:34,383 --> 01:04:36,594
You can find them
at SR Wedding Hall in Erode.

1053
01:04:37,453 --> 01:04:38,555
They're hiding out there.

1054
01:04:38,678 --> 01:04:40,069
Can I trust your word?

1055
01:04:41,331 --> 01:04:42,641
Armed gangster!

1056
01:04:44,518 --> 01:04:47,086
Today,
I'm going to end your reign for good.

1057
01:04:49,938 --> 01:04:52,086
Son, come with me.

1058
01:04:53,661 --> 01:04:55,297
Ma'am, you come with me too.

1059
01:05:08,560 --> 01:05:09,297
Shoot!

1060
01:05:10,337 --> 01:05:11,224
Bloody shoot me!

1061
01:05:26,817 --> 01:05:28,570
Hey, Chunnilal, start the car.

1062
01:05:33,459 --> 01:05:35,703
Das, let's leave.
He is here until tomorrow.

1063
01:05:37,583 --> 01:05:39,758
What happened?
All okay?

1064
01:05:40,878 --> 01:05:41,555
Come on, get in.

1065
01:05:42,404 --> 01:05:44,653
-Hey!
-Das, are we doing it today?

1066
01:05:44,813 --> 01:05:46,680
-Are we taking him out tonight?
-What are you doing, Das?

1067
01:05:46,705 --> 01:05:47,617
Shut up, you moron!

1068
01:05:47,945 --> 01:05:49,726
Why are you yelling at me?

1069
01:05:49,751 --> 01:05:50,359
Hey!

1070
01:05:50,633 --> 01:05:52,758
-Hey, don't stop him.
-He's going to cause major trouble.

1071
01:05:58,648 --> 01:05:59,439
Hey!

1072
01:06:03,387 --> 01:06:05,425
-What are you looking for?
-Wallet.

1073
01:06:13,700 --> 01:06:16,944
Hey, would you like to play the board?

1074
01:06:55,176 --> 01:06:57,365
-Hey, check what's happening out there.
-Hurry up!

1075
01:07:09,756 --> 01:07:11,708
Dad! Dad!

1076
01:07:12,201 --> 01:07:13,654
No substantial background.

1077
01:07:13,721 --> 01:07:15,099
You can easily register her under any case.

1078
01:07:15,124 --> 01:07:17,715
Stop right there.
Where are you running off to?

1079
01:07:18,369 --> 01:07:19,865
What happened inside?

1080
01:07:23,390 --> 01:07:24,365
Who are you?!

1081
01:07:42,208 --> 01:07:43,240
Take away all the girls and leave.

1082
01:07:57,686 --> 01:07:58,466
Come on, let's play the board.

1083
01:08:39,726 --> 01:08:40,879
Everyone, come upstairs!

1084
01:08:44,922 --> 01:08:46,926
-Where are they running to?
-I think there's a problem upstairs.

1085
01:08:47,179 --> 01:08:49,094
-Hey!
-Why are so many people running?

1086
01:08:49,135 --> 01:08:51,161
-Hey, damn it! Let's go.
-Oh, no!

1087
01:08:55,858 --> 01:08:56,458
Hey!

1088
01:09:31,803 --> 01:09:32,588
Hey, Kitty!

1089
01:09:34,890 --> 01:09:36,643
Hey, don't spare anyone.
Shoot them all.

1090
01:09:36,858 --> 01:09:39,407
-Hey, run away, or else I'll shoot!
-Shoot everyone, Kitty!

1091
01:09:41,210 --> 01:09:42,424
Shoot everyone!

1092
01:09:42,635 --> 01:09:44,617
I'll handle them.
You, bring Das.

1093
01:09:50,328 --> 01:09:51,548
This is how I know the play board.

1094
01:09:56,429 --> 01:09:57,945
Hey, Das, what have you done?

1095
01:09:58,437 --> 01:10:00,219
This wasn't the plan.
Hurry up, now.

1096
01:10:00,944 --> 01:10:02,242
You keep the engine running
I'll come.

1097
01:10:02,793 --> 01:10:03,766
Damn, this guy!

1098
01:10:31,922 --> 01:10:33,828
Is he the one
who kept you locked up in here?

1099
01:10:52,020 --> 01:10:53,133
The other girls escaped.

1100
01:10:54,092 --> 01:10:54,633
You, too, leave.

1101
01:12:08,478 --> 01:12:09,218
Das!

1102
01:12:11,020 --> 01:12:12,057
Das, hurry up!

1103
01:12:12,906 --> 01:12:13,964
Come on, Das!

1104
01:12:14,609 --> 01:12:16,000
Hey, who's that girl?

1105
01:12:17,195 --> 01:12:18,148
-Hey?
-Hey, wait!

1106
01:12:18,851 --> 01:12:19,984
Didn't I tell you to go away somewhere?

1107
01:12:20,009 --> 01:12:21,386
-Why is he speaking to her?
-Das, who is she?

1108
01:12:21,411 --> 01:12:22,293
I told you to leave!

1109
01:12:22,319 --> 01:12:23,945
I don't know where to go.

1110
01:12:23,970 --> 01:12:26,336
-Hey, why are you indulging her?
-I freakin' know. Shut up!

1111
01:12:26,612 --> 01:12:27,141
I know!

1112
01:12:28,311 --> 01:12:29,820
I don't know where to go.

1113
01:12:37,995 --> 01:12:39,672
Come with me.
I'll drop you off somewhere safe.

1114
01:12:39,697 --> 01:12:41,234
We're not safe ourselves
and you're offering her safety.

1115
01:12:41,271 --> 01:12:41,820
Hey!

1116
01:12:43,511 --> 01:12:45,344
Hey, Das, bring her quickly.

1117
01:12:45,369 --> 01:12:47,061
-Why are you encouraging him?
-Hey, stop yelling!

1118
01:12:47,086 --> 01:12:48,883
-Why are you guys always fighting?
-Get inside the car!

1119
01:12:48,908 --> 01:12:50,875
-First, bring that chick with us.
-Hey, Chunnilal, I should throw you out.

1120
01:12:50,905 --> 01:12:51,552
You get in, and we'll help you.

1121
01:12:51,592 --> 01:12:53,438
Hey, girl, stop gazing and get inside.

1122
01:12:53,491 --> 01:12:55,544
-Das has already agreed.
-You guys are inviting trouble.

1123
01:12:55,569 --> 01:12:58,328
Listen, we have no time.
Are you coming or not?

1124
01:12:59,092 --> 01:13:01,617
Hey, Das has already agreed.
Get inside the car.

1125
01:13:01,697 --> 01:13:03,586
Hey, get inside the car!

1126
01:13:03,728 --> 01:13:04,341
Get in!

1127
01:13:05,679 --> 01:13:07,594
Get inside! Start the car!

1128
01:13:07,770 --> 01:13:10,812
We're already neck-deep in danger.
I don't know how to explain this to Arasu.

1129
01:14:23,708 --> 01:14:25,203
Hey! Hey!

1130
01:14:26,651 --> 01:14:27,371
Look over there.

1131
01:14:28,574 --> 01:14:30,867
The girl you brought along might die.
Bring her back!

1132
01:14:57,620 --> 01:14:58,469
Thanks!

1133
01:15:00,024 --> 01:15:00,870
For what?

1134
01:15:01,339 --> 01:15:04,023
You hesitate to tell the truth
to those you know.

1135
01:15:04,580 --> 01:15:07,687
But you can pour your heart out
to a stranger.

1136
01:15:08,759 --> 01:15:13,961
Anyone who I've been with
will share their stories with me.

1137
01:15:15,063 --> 01:15:17,601
I, too, used to share my story with them.

1138
01:15:18,310 --> 01:15:20,016
Half our clients are Police.

1139
01:15:20,809 --> 01:15:22,820
They are well aware of
what's happening out here.

1140
01:15:24,070 --> 01:15:27,328
That they've locked up girls
and are running a business.

1141
01:15:27,944 --> 01:15:29,555
Yet no one cares to help.

1142
01:15:36,125 --> 01:15:37,101
So, I thanked you.

1143
01:15:40,678 --> 01:15:42,375
Why did you come back?

1144
01:15:45,901 --> 01:15:47,516
They killed my mother
when I was very young.

1145
01:15:48,641 --> 01:15:50,031
So, I killed them and was in prison.

1146
01:15:51,238 --> 01:15:53,781
So, I know what it's like
to be locked inside 4 walls.

1147
01:15:54,681 --> 01:15:55,984
I thought about it and came back.

1148
01:16:05,573 --> 01:16:09,062
I was afraid
that I would never experience nature.

1149
01:16:12,120 --> 01:16:12,609
Why?

1150
01:16:15,381 --> 01:16:17,437
When a woman turns older,
around 38-40 years,

1151
01:16:18,469 --> 01:16:19,758
they kill them by poisoning their food.

1152
01:16:20,343 --> 01:16:22,203
And discard their body somewhere.

1153
01:16:23,101 --> 01:16:24,445
Why are you stirring up old stories?

1154
01:16:25,101 --> 01:16:25,992
Now, you're out of that hell.

1155
01:16:26,562 --> 01:16:28,016
So, find a way to live a good life.

1156
01:16:30,117 --> 01:16:33,945
I thought they would let me out
when I turned 12.

1157
01:16:35,452 --> 01:16:42,437
I, too, wished to get married
and have children like anyone else.

1158
01:16:44,304 --> 01:16:47,984
Later, that wish disappeared.

1159
01:16:48,778 --> 01:16:51,601
Why? Did all the men in the world die?

1160
01:16:52,463 --> 01:16:54,094
You can still get married and settle down.

1161
01:17:06,555 --> 01:17:07,281
Don't bother about me.

1162
01:17:08,656 --> 01:17:09,437
Who are you, people?

1163
01:17:10,398 --> 01:17:11,594
Do you have a father?

1164
01:17:13,141 --> 01:17:14,336
It's not like I'm God.

1165
01:17:14,995 --> 01:17:15,742
I do have a father.

1166
01:17:17,439 --> 01:17:18,633
Does he not live with you?

1167
01:17:20,748 --> 01:17:22,219
He knows that he won't be safe
if he lives with me.

1168
01:17:23,026 --> 01:17:24,107
That's why he's away from me.

1169
01:17:24,463 --> 01:17:27,055
Doesn't it occur to you to see him?

1170
01:17:27,767 --> 01:17:29,070
Are you asking me
the same question I asked?

1171
01:17:29,961 --> 01:17:30,547
Go and rest well.

1172
01:17:30,953 --> 01:17:32,930
I'll find a way
to drop you off somewhere safe.

1173
01:17:41,867 --> 01:17:42,351
Oi!

1174
01:17:45,191 --> 01:17:47,726
My name is Chandra.
What's your name?

1175
01:17:52,703 --> 01:17:53,430
Devadas!

1176
01:17:56,820 --> 01:17:58,141
Arasu Bro is not answering my calls.

1177
01:17:58,555 --> 01:18:00,359
And he's oblivious to the issue at hand
and brought her along.

1178
01:18:01,476 --> 01:18:03,797
Hey, Kitty, we're in the middle of nowhere.

1179
01:18:03,822 --> 01:18:04,783
And you're saying
he's not answering your call.

1180
01:18:05,094 --> 01:18:08,180
As per the instructions I got,
we were supposed to be at the wedding hall.

1181
01:18:10,890 --> 01:18:11,877
Okay, okay.

1182
01:18:12,465 --> 01:18:13,433
Hey, Kitty, pass me the bag.

1183
01:18:51,987 --> 01:18:53,838
At least there are 50 SIM cards
in this bag.

1184
01:18:54,424 --> 01:18:57,152
So, they've been switching
SIM cards once every two days.

1185
01:18:59,482 --> 01:19:01,870
I'm sure not a single card
is registered in Arasu's name.

1186
01:19:04,955 --> 01:19:08,143
Anyway, trace the last SIM card
he used to call.

1187
01:19:08,389 --> 01:19:09,182
For whatever it's worth.

1188
01:19:12,026 --> 01:19:13,653
Hey, I'm surprised you're getting married
at your age.

1189
01:19:13,678 --> 01:19:15,432
Hey, Kitty, I agree with what you said.

1190
01:19:15,738 --> 01:19:16,995
So we, too, have a chance in life.

1191
01:19:18,219 --> 01:19:19,729
Yeah, I will be there.

1192
01:19:20,526 --> 01:19:23,478
As you mentioned, we'll go to Andhra,
find a girl, and get married.

1193
01:19:23,503 --> 01:19:25,058
-What do you say, Kitty?
-Hey, Karuppu, shut up, dude.

1194
01:19:25,432 --> 01:19:26,754
Instructions are to leave in the morning.

1195
01:19:26,818 --> 01:19:27,799
So, you guys stay right here.

1196
01:19:28,008 --> 01:19:29,456
I'll send across food and booze.

1197
01:19:29,658 --> 01:19:31,659
If you need anything else,
give me a shout, I'll come over.

1198
01:19:34,081 --> 01:19:36,448
Hey, I'm not able to reach Arasu, Bro!

1199
01:19:36,495 --> 01:19:37,768
-Saami, did he speak to you?
-The money is in this bag.

1200
01:19:38,128 --> 01:19:39,945
He called me the day before
and asked to collect the money.

1201
01:19:40,143 --> 01:19:41,167
After that, he didn't call me either.

1202
01:19:50,260 --> 01:19:52,073
I hope it includes my commission.

1203
01:19:52,401 --> 01:19:54,190
At least give me an advance,
I'll sort it out.

1204
01:19:54,533 --> 01:19:56,172
Hey, I can't settle your account now.

1205
01:19:56,354 --> 01:19:58,003
Once the work is done,
we'll split the money.

1206
01:19:58,706 --> 01:20:02,036
If you go back on your word
and do not pay me my commission

1207
01:20:02,378 --> 01:20:03,128
I'll get violent!

1208
01:20:03,674 --> 01:20:04,010
Hey!

1209
01:20:06,729 --> 01:20:07,307
Did you get him?

1210
01:20:15,869 --> 01:20:17,612
What is it, Chunnilal?

1211
01:20:17,885 --> 01:20:19,799
-Big deal is going down.
-Okay.

1212
01:20:20,401 --> 01:20:21,995
-Border crossing!
-What about it?

1213
01:20:22,844 --> 01:20:24,940
-Also, there's a girl here.
-Entrusting you?

1214
01:20:25,232 --> 01:20:26,979
I'm the guardian of women.

1215
01:20:28,481 --> 01:20:30,815
Hey, you brought that girl along.
What are you planning to do?

1216
01:20:32,622 --> 01:20:34,331
I spoke to Saami.
He will handle it.

1217
01:20:34,685 --> 01:20:36,745
-I'll be back in a minute.
-I wonder what you spoke about.

1218
01:20:41,190 --> 01:20:41,901
I'll speak to them.

1219
01:20:42,549 --> 01:20:44,081
[in Hindi] I'll speak to them.
Don't worry.

1220
01:20:44,510 --> 01:20:46,307
What are you blabbering in Telugu?

1221
01:20:47,628 --> 01:20:49,182
-Telugu, you say?
-It isn't?

1222
01:20:49,404 --> 01:20:51,635
Moron! I'm speaking in Hindi.

1223
01:20:51,823 --> 01:20:52,588
Okay.

1224
01:20:52,870 --> 01:20:54,057
-Bear this in mind.
-What?

1225
01:20:54,619 --> 01:20:55,753
Chunnilal-Chandra.

1226
01:20:55,933 --> 01:20:56,693
Okay.

1227
01:20:56,907 --> 01:20:58,135
Don't our names match?

1228
01:20:59,816 --> 01:21:01,510
-What is it?
-Social service.

1229
01:21:02,018 --> 01:21:03,760
-Go to a corner and continue.
-Okay.

1230
01:21:21,111 --> 01:21:22,041
We're leaving in the morning.

1231
01:21:24,938 --> 01:21:27,573
Good job, three square meals,

1232
01:21:28,909 --> 01:21:29,534
and a place to stay.

1233
01:21:30,368 --> 01:21:32,628
Take it as your rebirth
and live a good life.

1234
01:21:39,229 --> 01:21:40,088
Where are you going?

1235
01:21:46,206 --> 01:21:46,995
I don't know.

1236
01:21:49,105 --> 01:21:50,221
I still have time until dawn to decide.

1237
01:21:55,235 --> 01:21:56,479
Brother, give me a cigarette.

1238
01:22:05,598 --> 01:22:07,432
All units move in!
All units move in!

1239
01:22:08,979 --> 01:22:09,565
What happened?

1240
01:22:10,336 --> 01:22:11,963
Nothing!
How much money is in there?

1241
01:22:13,652 --> 01:22:15,323
There are 10 lakhs in the bag.
What happened out there?

1242
01:22:18,768 --> 01:22:19,557
Kitty!

1243
01:22:20,487 --> 01:22:21,630
-Hey, Kitty!
-What happened?

1244
01:22:21,655 --> 01:22:23,213
They killed Arasu Bro.

1245
01:22:23,439 --> 01:22:24,768
-What are you saying?
-They killed Arasu Bro.

1246
01:22:24,792 --> 01:22:25,542
They killed Arasu?

1247
01:22:25,567 --> 01:22:27,010
-It's out in the paper.
-Wait a minute, let's verify.

1248
01:22:27,035 --> 01:22:29,854
What's his name?
Arokiadoss, call him.

1249
01:22:30,260 --> 01:22:31,370
I feel something's not right.

1250
01:22:31,395 --> 01:22:33,362
If they had killed Arasu,
they would've found us too.

1251
01:22:33,387 --> 01:22:35,275
-Are you serious?
-What do we do now?

1252
01:22:35,397 --> 01:22:36,807
Did you notice anything unusual?

1253
01:22:37,707 --> 01:22:39,286
Hey, please say something.

1254
01:22:39,340 --> 01:22:40,776
-I don't understand.
-What are you doing?

1255
01:22:41,682 --> 01:22:42,221
Hey!

1256
01:22:48,910 --> 01:22:50,401
Hey, run! Run!

1257
01:22:50,662 --> 01:22:52,042
Go! Go! Go! Go!

1258
01:22:52,291 --> 01:22:54,245
-Go! Go! Go!
-Hey, how did they find us?

1259
01:22:54,351 --> 01:22:55,706
Hey, Das, this way!

1260
01:22:59,503 --> 01:23:00,471
Hey, pick him up.

1261
01:23:00,854 --> 01:23:02,573
-Pick him up.
-Kitty! Oh, no!

1262
01:23:08,486 --> 01:23:09,669
It's hurting like hell!

1263
