1445
01:33:50,949 --> 01:33:52,943
We got the money.
Let's leave for Vellore.

1446
01:33:53,962 --> 01:33:54,896
This is the last one!

1447
01:33:56,798 --> 01:33:57,568
No need. Let's leave.

1448
01:33:57,997 --> 01:34:00,786
Das, it's just one more.
We've come all this way.

1449
01:34:01,387 --> 01:34:02,208
Why refuse when it's easy money?

1450
01:34:02,740 --> 01:34:03,700
Let's pick it up on our way out.

1451
01:34:04,621 --> 01:34:05,154
Kitty!

1452
01:34:28,585 --> 01:34:30,820
Hey, Silk, what are you doing here?

1453
01:34:34,010 --> 01:34:35,156
Das, the gun is missing.

1454
01:34:38,598 --> 01:34:39,788
Hey, be here, keep the engine running.

1455
01:34:41,809 --> 01:34:43,219
Hey, Kitty, check what's happening?

1456
01:34:43,244 --> 01:34:44,144
Start the car.

1457
01:34:44,180 --> 01:34:45,409
She got us into trouble.

1458
01:34:47,558 --> 01:34:49,000
Hey, Chunnilal, start the car.

1459
01:35:31,351 --> 01:35:34,225
Hey, stop gazing around.
Go and check, damn it!

1460
01:35:34,331 --> 01:35:35,687
What's wrong with you guys?

1461
01:35:47,918 --> 01:35:50,172
Sir, I swear I'm telling the truth.

1462
01:35:51,215 --> 01:35:53,219
They're going to
hand over the money in Vellore...

1463
01:35:53,788 --> 01:35:55,711
and cross-border to Andhra.

1464
01:35:56,257 --> 01:35:58,601
Also, there is a girl with them.

1465
01:35:59,628 --> 01:36:01,062
That's all I know, Sir.

1466
01:36:02,007 --> 01:36:03,476
So, you don't know for whom the money is?

1467
01:36:04,514 --> 01:36:06,930
I swear on my newlywed wife,
I don't know.

1468
01:36:12,279 --> 01:36:12,818
Hello?

1469
01:36:17,525 --> 01:36:19,672
Alert all the surrounding police stations.

1470
01:36:22,419 --> 01:36:23,922
They're still in Erode.

1471
01:36:24,522 --> 01:36:25,960
They killed a Doctor.

1472
01:36:50,990 --> 01:36:53,062
Listen, someone is heading over here.

1473
01:36:59,690 --> 01:37:00,937
-Who are you?
-Stay right there.

1474
01:37:01,855 --> 01:37:03,476
-What--?
-Stay calm. Don't scream.

1475
01:37:03,796 --> 01:37:04,637
How many people are here?

1476
01:37:04,970 --> 01:37:06,492
-Who else? How many are here?
-Only three of us.

1477
01:37:06,517 --> 01:37:07,369
Don't make a noise.

1478
01:37:07,925 --> 01:37:10,011
-Would anyone else be coming over?
-No one, Sir.

1479
01:37:10,153 --> 01:37:11,212
Das, come on!

1480
01:37:11,667 --> 01:37:13,356
-Stay silent. Don't scream.
-Go over there.

1481
01:37:15,909 --> 01:37:16,695
Put down your gun.

1482
01:37:17,359 --> 01:37:18,151
How many are out here?

1483
01:37:18,212 --> 01:37:20,844
It's just me, my wife, and the child.

1484
01:37:21,534 --> 01:37:22,878
We won't harm you.
Understand?

1485
01:37:22,903 --> 01:37:24,328
We will leave in the morning.
Stay quiet.

1486
01:37:24,539 --> 01:37:26,367
Hey, go around and check
if anyone else is around.

1487
01:37:27,617 --> 01:37:28,383
What's wrong with her?

1488
01:37:29,341 --> 01:37:31,703
She messed up everything.
Hey, move along.

1489
01:37:32,929 --> 01:37:33,375
Hey, around the back.

1490
01:37:33,905 --> 01:37:37,008
We'll leave by dawn.
We won't harm you, people.

1491
01:37:43,693 --> 01:37:45,445
Get inside.
Is anyone else out there?

1492
01:37:45,775 --> 01:37:47,609
-Did you check thoroughly?
-There's no one else.

1493
01:37:48,211 --> 01:37:50,268
